"Signal opens without asking for the wallet password (Wallet apps: Password first)"
msgstr ""
"Signal se abre sin pedir la contraseña de la cartera (Apps de la cartera: Contraseña primero)"

#: packs/integrations/signal/status.sh
msgid "key in wallet; password first; closes after %s min idle"
msgstr ""
"clave en la cartera; contraseña primero; se cierra tras %s min de inactividad"

