#: packs/third-party/pack.md
msgid "3rd Party"
msgstr "De terceros"

# needs review
#: packs/third-party/pack.md
msgid ""
"Other people's projects and fixes for the Steam Frame, credited to their authors. Most are linked (🔗): Frame Tweaks runs their own installer, as their README gives it, into your home folder, and they update their own way (↻ on their row). Fixes others found, such as the mouse cursor's and the menu icons', Frame Tweaks applies itself."
msgstr ""
"Proyectos y correcciones de otras personas para el Steam Frame, con el crédito a sus autores. La mayoría están vinculados (🔗): Frame Tweaks ejecuta su propio instalador, como lo indica su README, en tu carpeta personal, y se actualizan a su manera (↻ en su fila). Las correcciones que otros encontraron, como la del cursor del mouse y la de los íconos del menú, las aplica Frame Tweaks."

# needs review
#: packs/third-party/recline/README.md
msgid ""
"Lie back and keep playing. Recenter while lying back (SteamVR's own recenter) and the direction you're looking becomes level and forward in VR, at a chosen eye height; recentering upright puts everything back. It works for SteamVR apps, and your hands move with you."
msgstr ""
"Recuéstate y sigue jugando. Recentra mientras estás recostado (con el recentrado propio de SteamVR) y la dirección a la que miras queda nivelada y al frente en RV, a una altura de ojos elegida; recentrar erguido devuelve todo a su lugar. Funciona con las apps de SteamVR, y tus manos se mueven contigo."

#: packs/third-party/recline/README.md
msgid "Recline"
msgstr "Reclinar"

# needs review
#: packs/third-party/recline/README.md
msgid ""
"SteamVR's own recenter only turns you around; it can't tilt the world, so lying down leaves you looking at the ceiling. Linked: [Recline-VR](https://github.com/new-waifu/Recline-VR) builds and installs itself on the Frame, the way its README describes."
msgstr ""
"La opción Volver a centrar de SteamVR solo te gira; no puede inclinar el mundo, así que al acostarte terminas mirando el techo. Vinculado: [Recline-VR](https://github.com/new-waifu/Recline-VR) se compila e instala en el Frame por sí mismo, como lo describe su README."

# needs review
#: packs/third-party/recline/README.md
msgid ""
"Use VR lying down or reclined; recentering makes your view level and forward"
msgstr ""
"Usa la RV acostado o reclinado; recentrar deja tu vista nivelada y al frente"

